Files derived from ServingStudioSim
-----------------------------------
The following files are derived from ServingStudioSim
(https://github.com/SyFI-ServingStudio/ServingStudioSim): from its sim-to-real handoff
glm53_flash_pp4_b200_v1/v2 (doc/handoff/) or from its simulator's outputs. The ServingStudioSim
copyright holders make these files available under the Apache License, Version 2.0, as part of
this product:

  - bench/prefix.py: the window-metric functions (real_arrays, sim_arrays, window_metrics), ported
    from the handoff's data/metrics.py
  - bench/sim_rounds.py: the run export, using the columns and filter of the handoff's
    data/metrics.py
  - bench/targets_ext/*: prefix_targets_ext.py is a parameterized copy of the handoff's
    data/prefix_targets.py, make_prefix_ext.py follows its data/bringup/make_bringup.py, and the
    .csv/.json files are traces and simulator targets made with them
  - ppimpl/data/topk_rows.json: rows of the handoff's data/kernel_specs.jsonl
  - measured/sessions_sim/*: per-round exports of the simulator runs behind the handoff's targets
  - measured/victim_chain_rows.jsonl: simulator rows of the run 20261017_7_victim_chain

